# McCluster satellite / control plane

Always read AGENTS.md before editing.

- Control repo: mcclusterishere/mccluster
- Cloudflare project: mccluster (static edge at matthew.mccluster.org)
- Worker: mccluster-core (api.mccluster.org)
- Data: Supabase zmnhbrjyhxzhkxmhkexs
- Satellites render product UI. They do not own auth, social, billing, or admin.
- No CI git push onto feature branches.
- No competing backends.
- Preserve local product gates (PRIM3 Site 0, Uprise World, etc.).